{"4083940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Animal Bookshop: Tidy & Sell", "steam_appid": 4083940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animal bookshop is an organizing game where you also sell books to cute animals. An earthquake has turned your cozy bookshop upside down! Tidy the shelves, sort the books, and reopen the shop for your animal customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tidy at the back, sell at the front</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083940/extras/3b697ebf596e0c061f86ac230798fec6.poster.avif?t=1787557228\" width=700 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083940/extras/3b697ebf596e0c061f86ac230798fec6.webm?t=1787557228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083940/extras/3b697ebf596e0c061f86ac230798fec6.mp4?t=1787557228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your shop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083940/extras/7bbda8703dfee3373c3323d4d19f93c7.poster.avif?t=1787557228\" width=700 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083940/extras/7bbda8703dfee3373c3323d4d19f93c7.mp4?t=1787557228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start off with 1000+ books out of place. Sort all the books to where they belong, one at a time. You can choose to serve customers while sorting, or serve them at a later time when you are satisfied with your bookshop's condition. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selling each book earns you money, which you can use to expand your bookshop, or learn new skills. Sorting and selling will become easier as you progress through the game. You can choose to not learn any skills and do everything manually instead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features-</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize 1000+ books, every book has its place</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play at your own pace, there is no rush</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your bookshop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new book genres as you progress through the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden secrets and rare items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn new skills to make everything easier</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animal bookshop is an organizing game where you also sell books to cute animals. An earthquake has turned your cozy bookshop upside down! Tidy the shelves, sort the books, and reopen the shop for your animal customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tidy at the back, sell at the front</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083940/extras/3b697ebf596e0c061f86ac230798fec6.poster.avif?t=1787557228\" width=700 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083940/extras/3b697ebf596e0c061f86ac230798fec6.webm?t=1787557228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083940/extras/3b697ebf596e0c061f86ac230798fec6.mp4?t=1787557228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your shop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_im